---
import PageHero from "../components/PageHero.astro";
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import { contactEmail } from '../config';
---
<Site title="Partners"><PageHero eyebrow="Partners" title="A stronger circle of support." id="8412361" alt="Two camera operators working together"/><section class="page-opening"><p class="eyebrow">Partners</p><p>An invitation to collaborate. No new partnerships are implied.</p><div class="numbered"><div><h2>Youth &amp; community organisations</h2><p>Help shape a referral pathway that respects consent, privacy and each young person's goals. We want to discuss access barriers and clear boundaries between training and specialist care.</p></div><div><h2>Venues &amp; production professionals</h2><p>Explore hosting a training Saturday or supervised crew experience. Working technicians can mentor; police checks and the program's safeguarding requirements apply.</p></div><div><h2>Donors &amp; equipment supporters</h2><p>$40 covers one participant's course materials for the full eight weeks. $90 covers a term of transit stipends so a participant can actually get to training. $250 goes to the gear library: the shared kit participants learn on and borrow for first calls.</p><p>Working AV equipment is also welcome.</p></div></div><p>Enquiries: <a href={"mailto:"+contactEmail}>{contactEmail}</a> · Placeholder contact</p><figure><img src="https://doop.design/photos/pexels/11410604.jpeg?h=650&w=940" alt="Production crew preparing equipment backstage"/><figcaption>Illustrative photography</figcaption></figure></section></Site>
